### Game-derived images that ARE vendored here, under no grant

**65 image files in `priv/static/images/` are derived from Battlestate Games'
own artwork and are covered by no licence from anyone**, including this NOTICE:

| Directory | Files | What they are |
|---|---|---|
| `ranks/` | 16 | PMC rank emblems |
| `hideout/` | 26 | Hideout station icons |
| `chapters/` | 10 | Storyline chapter art |
| `items/missing/` | 9 | Item placeholder art |
| `icons/` | 4 | Faction / game-mode icons |

They are stated here rather than omitted because omitting them, next to the
sentence above, would read as a claim that this repository redistributes no game
imagery — which is not true. Neither Battlestate Games nor the Escape from Tarkov
Wiki has granted a licence for them: the wiki licenses its contributors' **prose**
under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 and cannot sublicense Battlestate's material (see below), so
no CC grant reaches these files. The four faction/mode icons additionally appear
to originate from Battlestate's own website rather than the wiki.

They are retained for now only because removing them breaks the running UI, and
the intended resolution is to hot-link them the way item icons already are, or to
replace them. **Anyone redistributing this repository redistributes them too, and
does so with no permission from the rights holder.** If you fork this, remove
them. Takedown requests will be honoured immediately — see the contact link in the
application footer.

The 18 marker icons in `priv/static/images/maps/markers/` are a separate,
smaller unknown: their provenance is not recorded and this project makes no
ownership claim over them. See
[`priv/static/images/maps/ATTRIBUTION.md`](priv/static/images/maps/ATTRIBUTION.md).

The Escape from Tarkov Wiki licenses its contributors' **prose** under
